    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. SDG targets and indicators related to green growth investments
Based on the baselines above, UNDP and partner organisations identified a few SDG targets and indicators to measure specific initiatives of the Joint Fund:
SDG 6: Ensure availability and sustainable management of water and sanitation for all
